    "title": "Warrants issued for six people in Lipscomb after fighting caught on video - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBRC Digital Staff ,\n2 days ago LIPSCOMB, Ala. (WBRC) - Warrants have been issued for six people in Lipscomb in relation to a video shared of teenagers and young adults fighting. On Friday, Sept. 26, the Lipscomb Police Department shared the video of the fighting, merely three weeks after a video of three sisters being arrested went viral. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
